<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASTAD, Sweden 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results from</p>
<p>the Swedish Open tennis tournament (played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Henrik Dreekman (Germany) 6-1 4-6</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-2 1-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Thomas Nydahl (Sweden) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-2.</p>
</text>
